WEBVTT

00:00:00.476 --> 00:00:01.174
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.016 --> 00:00:04.492
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I goes out and I fire up the old lawnmower

00:00:04.492 --> 00:00:07.843
and about 25 minutes into cutting the grass I just happen to look up

00:00:07.843 --> 00:00:10.623
and there stood two white gentlemen that I’d never seen before.

00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:13.334
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.456
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I said, ‘Well, you got the wrong guy.

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:16.742
I ain’t done none of that.’

00:00:18.657 --> 00:00:19.490
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:20.302 --> 00:00:24.942
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I kept wondering, how a innocent man that was out cutting grass,

00:00:24.942 --> 00:00:31.993
how do he go from cutting grass to all of a sudden his whole world is turned upside down,

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:36.625
and now the judge is saying, ‘I sentence you to death’.

00:00:38.733 --> 00:00:39.456
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:40.376 --> 00:00:45.097
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> And they told me how proud they was that I was going home,

00:00:45.335 --> 00:00:48.250
and even some gave me advice, and:

00:00:48.369 --> 00:00:52.795
‘Pop, it’s a different world out there than what you was used to.’

00:00:54.835 --> 00:00:55.697
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:56.498 --> 00:00:58.635
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I don’t care when it raining,

00:00:58.754 --> 00:01:04.800
I walks in the rain because for 30 years rain was not allowed to fall on my body,

00:01:04.919 --> 00:01:11.487
and every time it rain I walks in the rain, it feel, like, so cool and so refreshing.